<ol class="panels">
<li data-stage="0"><h3><span class="stage">Assess</span>Evidence where there is opinion</h3><p>A two-week, read-only diagnostic across five dimensions, from delivery to spend, including the harness you already have. A silent-failure register shows where AI is quietly wrong, who owns it, and how long it would take to notice.</p></li>
<li data-stage="1"><h3><span class="stage">Enhance</span>A harness that holds</h3><p>Depending on where you start, we bring our harness or strengthen yours: agent rules, quality gates on every change, evaluations, security guardrails and decision rights. All of it in your accounts.</p></li>
<li data-stage="2"><h3><span class="stage">Evolve</span>You own it, we keep it current</h3><p>A do-it-yourself pathway, code and accounts in your name. Capability, not dependency. If you want, we stay on to keep it current as models and tools change.</p></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>

